## The volcano path, the chasm and the rooms beyond it.

## Room 12. LOOK.BAS 1200 and 1250.

create the Volcano View
  a room
  room name:
    Volcano view
  exits, one-way: east to the Mountain Passage, southeast to the Chasm Rim

  You are on a path going SE to E, overlooking a great active volcano.

## Room 41. LOOK.BAS 4100 and 4150.

create the Mountain Passage
  a room
  room name:
    Mountain passage
  exits, one-way: south to the Volcano View, southwest to the Sphere Room

  You are walking along a passage on the side of a mountain.{br}
  Below you are some ancient buildings.

## Room 42. LOOK.BAS 4200 and 4250.

create the Chasm Rim
  a room
  room name:
    You are on the north side of a giant chasm.
  exits, one-way: east to the Volcano View, west to the North Side of Chasm

  You are on the north side of a giant chasm.

## Room 43. LOOK.BAS 4300 and 4350.

create the North Side of Chasm
  a room
  room name:
    North side of chasm
  exits, one-way: north to the Chasm Bridge, northeast to the Chasm Rim

  North side of chasm

## Room 44. LOOK.BAS 4400 and 4450.

create the Chasm Bridge
  a room
  room name:
    You are on a bridge which spans the giant chasm.
  exits, one-way: north to the Far Side of Chasm, northeast to the North Side of Chasm

  You are on a bridge which spans the giant chasm.

## Room 45. LOOK.BAS 4500 and 4550.

create the Far Side of Chasm
  a room
  room name:
    You are on the far side of the chasm. A passage goes east to west.
  exits, one-way: east to the Hall of Doors, west to the North-South Room, south to the Chasm Bridge

  You are on the far side of the chasm. A passage goes east to west.

## Room 46. LOOK.BAS 4600 and 4650.

create the North-South Room
  a room
  room name:
    This is a room with exits north and south.
  exits, one-way: north to the Garbage Dump, northeast to the Far Side of Chasm

  This is a room with exits north and south.

## Room 47. LOOK.BAS 4700 and 4750.

create the Garbage Dump
  a room
  room name:
    Garbage dump
  exits, one-way: south to the North-South Room, out to the North-South Room

  You are in what once was the garbage dump of the ancient cities,{br}
  although the garbage has been eaten by rats.

## Room 48. LOOK.BAS 4800 and 4850.

create the Hall of Doors
  a room
  room name:
    You are in a hall with doors west, east, and south.
  exits, one-way: east to the City Enterance, west to the Dwarf City, south to the Far Side of Chasm, out to the Far Side of Chasm

  You are in a hall with doors west, east, and south.
